{
  "name": "printer-screen-vantage-scan",
  "skill_id": "printer-screen-vantage-scan",
  "notes": [
    "Catalog search returned no results; node types chosen from the standard n8n core set referenced by the skill's tool calls (dog_move / dog_wait_arrived / dog_capture).",
    "Each vantage is a move → wait → capture sequence; the If after each capture checks readable and routes to the next vantage on false.",
    "Vantage order and failure reasons come from skill lines 25-29; the trajectory confirms front (too small) → closer (glare) → oblique (readable).",
    "dog_* tool endpoints are not specified in the skill, so HTTP nodes carry needs_user_input for url/credential.",
    "inline_io",
    "drop_literal_seed_sets"
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Start Case",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "slots": {},
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "13",
        "quote": "For each candidate vantage in order, run exactly this sequence:"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Wait arrived at front",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "mode": "set",
        "assignments": {
          "job_id": "={{ $json.job_id }}"
        }
      },
      "tool": "dog_wait_arrived",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "17",
        "quote": "dog_wait_arrived({\"job_id\": \"<job_id from dog_move>\"})"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Front readable?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.readable }}",
        "op": "equal",
        "right": "true",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "25",
        "quote": "`print-area-front` — baseline. If `readable: false` with reason `screen text too small`, move closer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "name": "Wait arrived at front-closer",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "mode": "set",
        "assignments": {
          "job_id": "={{ $json.job_id }}"
        }
      },
      "tool": "dog_wait_arrived",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "17",
        "quote": "dog_wait_arrived({\"job_id\": \"<job_id from dog_move>\"})"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "name": "Front-closer readable?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.readable }}",
        "op": "equal",
        "right": "true",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "26",
        "quote": "If `readable: false` with reason `glare` (reflection on the front of the screen), the front is unusable; switch to an oblique angle."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "name": "Wait arrived at oblique-front",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "mode": "set",
        "assignments": {
          "job_id": "={{ $json.job_id }}"
        }
      },
      "tool": "dog_wait_arrived",
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "17",
        "quote": "dog_wait_arrived({\"job_id\": \"<job_id from dog_move>\"})"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "name": "Oblique-front readable?",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "slots": {
        "left": "={{ $json.readable }}",
        "op": "equal",
        "right": "true",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "21",
        "quote": "Only report a result after a `dog_capture` returns `readable: true`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "name": "Report readable result",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "screen_text": "={{ $json.screen_text }}",
          "paper_out": "={{ $json.paper_out }}",
          "vantage": "print-area-oblique-front",
          "report": "=这台打印机显示{{ $json.screen_text }}。有效观察位是 print-area-oblique-front（正面反光、靠近后仍看不清）。\nDONE case={{ $json.id }} paper_out={{ $json.paper_out }} vantage=print-area-oblique-front"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "36",
        "quote": "这台打印机显示<screen text>。有效观察位是 <vantage>（<brief reason earlier vantages failed>）。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "name": "Report no readable vantage",
      "n8n_type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "slots": {
        "assignments": {
          "readable": "={{ $json.readable }}",
          "failure_reason": "={{ $json.reason }}",
          "report": "=没有可读的观察位；print-area-oblique-front 失败原因：{{ $json.reason }}"
        },
        "include_other_fields": true
      },
      "tool": null,
      "source": {
        "kind": "skill_line",
        "locator": "40",
        "quote": "If no candidate vantage yields `readable: true`, say so explicitly and list the failure reasons per vantage instead of guessing the screen content."
      }
    }
  ],
